# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository itself, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting -- this is what dprint.json's
# newLineKind: "lf" assumes. Without this, a commit made from a machine
# with different line-ending settings could reintroduce CRLF into the
# stored objects, which the scheduled Lint and Format workflow would then
# revert on its next run: a permanent churn loop between contributors and
# CI rather than a one-time normalization.
* text=auto eol=lf
